{"page":404,"verses":[{"verse_key":"29:64","surah":29,"ayah":64,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا هَـٰذِهِ ٱلْحَيَوٰةُ ٱلدُّنْيَآ إِلَّا لَهْوٌ وَلَعِبٌ ۚ وَإِنَّ ٱلدَّارَ ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةَ لَهِىَ ٱلْحَيَوَانُ ۚ لَوْ كَانُوا۟ يَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The life of this world is merely an amusement and a diversion; the true life is in the Hereafter, if only they knew.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"29:64"},{"pos":2,"ar":"هَـٰذِهِ","en_gloss":"(is) this","transliteration":"hādhihi","verse_key":"29:64"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةُ","en_gloss":"life","transliteration":"l-ḥayatu","verse_key":"29:64"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَآ","en_gloss":"(of) the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"29:64"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"29:64"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَهْوٌۭ","en_gloss":"amusement","transliteration":"lahwun","verse_key":"29:64"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَلَعِبٌۭ ۚ","en_gloss":"and play","transliteration":"walaʿibun","verse_key":"29:64"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"wa-inna","verse_key":"29:64"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلدَّارَ","en_gloss":"the Home","transliteration":"l-dāra","verse_key":"29:64"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةَ","en_gloss":"(of) the Hereafter ","transliteration":"l-ākhirata","verse_key":"29:64"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَهِىَ","en_gloss":"surely, it","transliteration":"lahiya","verse_key":"29:64"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْحَيَوَانُ ۚ","en_gloss":"(is) the life","transliteration":"l-ḥayawānu","verse_key":"29:64"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَوْ","en_gloss":"if only","transliteration":"law","verse_key":"29:64"},{"pos":14,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"29:64"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"know","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","verse_key":"29:64"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٦٤","en_gloss":"(64)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"29:64"}]},{"verse_key":"29:65","surah":29,"ayah":65,"ar_uthmani":"فَإِذَا رَكِبُوا۟ فِى ٱلْفُلْكِ دَعَوُا۟ ٱللَّهَ مُخْلِصِينَ لَهُ ٱلدِّينَ فَلَمَّا نَجَّىٰهُمْ إِلَى ٱلْبَرِّ إِذَا هُمْ يُشْرِكُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Whenever they go on board a ship they call on God, and dedicate their faith to Him alone, but once He has delivered them safely back to land, see how they ascribe partners to Him!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"fa-idhā","verse_key":"29:65"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رَكِبُوا۟","en_gloss":"they embark","transliteration":"rakibū","verse_key":"29:65"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"[in]","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"29:65"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْفُلْكِ","en_gloss":"the ship","transliteration":"l-ful'ki","verse_key":"29:65"},{"pos":5,"ar":"دَعَوُا۟","en_gloss":"they call","transliteration":"daʿawū","verse_key":"29:65"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"29:65"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مُخْلِصِينَ","en_gloss":"(being) sincere","transliteration":"mukh'liṣīna","verse_key":"29:65"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَهُ","en_gloss":"to Him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"29:65"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلدِّينَ","en_gloss":"(in) the religion","transliteration":"l-dīna","verse_key":"29:65"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَلَمَّا","en_gloss":"But when","transliteration":"falammā","verse_key":"29:65"},{"pos":11,"ar":"نَجَّىٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"He delivers them","transliteration":"najjāhum","verse_key":"29:65"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"29:65"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْبَرِّ","en_gloss":"the land","transliteration":"l-bari","verse_key":"29:65"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"behold","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"29:65"},{"pos":15,"ar":"هُمْ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"29:65"},{"pos":16,"ar":"يُشْرِكُونَ","en_gloss":"associate partners (with Him)","transliteration":"yush'rikūna","verse_key":"29:65"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٦٥","en_gloss":"(65)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"29:65"}]},{"verse_key":"29:66","surah":29,"ayah":66,"ar_uthmani":"لِيَكْفُرُوا۟ بِمَآ ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُمْ وَلِيَتَمَتَّعُوا۟ ۖ فَسَوْفَ يَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Let them show their ingratitude for what We have given them; let them take their enjoyment- soon they will know.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لِيَكْفُرُوا۟","en_gloss":"So that they may deny","transliteration":"liyakfurū","verse_key":"29:66"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِمَآ","en_gloss":"[in] what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"29:66"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"We have given them","transliteration":"ātaynāhum","verse_key":"29:66"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَلِيَتَمَتَّعُوا۟ ۖ","en_gloss":"and they may enjoy (themselves)","transliteration":"waliyatamattaʿū","verse_key":"29:66"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَسَوْفَ","en_gloss":"But soon","transliteration":"fasawfa","verse_key":"29:66"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"they will know","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","verse_key":"29:66"},{"pos":7,"ar":"٦٦","en_gloss":"(66)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"29:66"}]},{"verse_key":"29:67","surah":29,"ayah":67,"ar_uthmani":"أَوَلَمْ يَرَوْا۟ أَنَّا جَعَلْنَا حَرَمًا ءَامِنًا وَيُتَخَطَّفُ ٱلنَّاسُ مِنْ حَوْلِهِمْ ۚ أَفَبِٱلْبَـٰطِلِ يُؤْمِنُونَ وَبِنِعْمَةِ ٱللَّهِ يَكْفُرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Can they not see that We have made [them] a secure sanctuary though all around them people are snatched away? Then how can they believe in what is false and deny God’s blessing?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَوَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Do not","transliteration":"awalam","verse_key":"29:67"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَرَوْا۟","en_gloss":"they see","transliteration":"yaraw","verse_key":"29:67"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنَّا","en_gloss":"that We","transliteration":"annā","verse_key":"29:67"},{"pos":4,"ar":"جَعَلْنَا","en_gloss":"have made","transliteration":"jaʿalnā","verse_key":"29:67"},{"pos":5,"ar":"حَرَمًا","en_gloss":"a Sanctuary","transliteration":"ḥaraman","verse_key":"29:67"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ءَامِنًۭا","en_gloss":"secure","transliteration":"āminan","verse_key":"29:67"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَيُتَخَطَّفُ","en_gloss":"while are being taken away","transliteration":"wayutakhaṭṭafu","verse_key":"29:67"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسُ","en_gloss":"the people","transliteration":"l-nāsu","verse_key":"29:67"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"around them","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"29:67"},{"pos":10,"ar":"حَوْلِهِمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"around them","transliteration":"ḥawlihim","verse_key":"29:67"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَفَبِٱلْبَـٰطِلِ","en_gloss":"Then do in (the) falsehood","transliteration":"afabil-bāṭili","verse_key":"29:67"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"they believe","transliteration":"yu'minūna","verse_key":"29:67"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَبِنِعْمَةِ","en_gloss":"and in (the) Favor","transliteration":"wabiniʿ'mati","verse_key":"29:67"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"29:67"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يَكْفُرُونَ","en_gloss":"they disbelieve","transliteration":"yakfurūna","verse_key":"29:67"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٦٧","en_gloss":"(67)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"29:67"}]},{"verse_key":"29:68","surah":29,"ayah":68,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَنْ أَظْلَمُ مِمَّنِ ٱفْتَرَىٰ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ كَذِبًا أَوْ كَذَّبَ بِٱلْحَقِّ لَمَّا جَآءَهُۥٓ ۚ أَلَيْسَ فِى جَهَنَّمَ مَثْوًى لِّلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Who could be more wicked than the person who invents lies about God, or denies the truth when it comes to him? Is Hell not the home for the disbelievers?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَنْ","en_gloss":"And who","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"29:68"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَظْلَمُ","en_gloss":"(is) more unjust","transliteration":"aẓlamu","verse_key":"29:68"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِمَّنِ","en_gloss":"than (he) who","transliteration":"mimmani","verse_key":"29:68"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","en_gloss":"invents","transliteration":"if'tarā","verse_key":"29:68"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"against","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"29:68"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"29:68"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كَذِبًا","en_gloss":"a lie","transliteration":"kadhiban","verse_key":"29:68"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"29:68"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كَذَّبَ","en_gloss":"denies","transliteration":"kadhaba","verse_key":"29:68"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","en_gloss":"the truth","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","verse_key":"29:68"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَمَّا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"lammā","verse_key":"29:68"},{"pos":12,"ar":"جَآءَهُۥٓ ۚ","en_gloss":"it has come to him","transliteration":"jāahu","verse_key":"29:68"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَلَيْسَ","en_gloss":"Is there not","transliteration":"alaysa","verse_key":"29:68"},{"pos":14,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"29:68"},{"pos":15,"ar":"جَهَنَّمَ","en_gloss":"Hell","transliteration":"jahannama","verse_key":"29:68"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مَثْوًۭى","en_gloss":"an abode","transliteration":"mathwan","verse_key":"29:68"},{"pos":17,"ar":"لِّلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_gloss":"for the disbelievers","transliteration":"lil'kāfirīna","verse_key":"29:68"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٦٨","en_gloss":"(68)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"29:68"}]},{"verse_key":"29:69","surah":29,"ayah":69,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ جَـٰهَدُوا۟ فِينَا لَنَهْدِيَنَّهُمْ سُبُلَنَا ۚ وَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَمَعَ ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But We shall be sure to guide to Our ways those who strive hard for Our cause: God is with those who do good.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"And those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"29:69"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَـٰهَدُوا۟","en_gloss":"strive","transliteration":"jāhadū","verse_key":"29:69"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِينَا","en_gloss":"for Us","transliteration":"fīnā","verse_key":"29:69"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَنَهْدِيَنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"We will surely, guide them","transliteration":"lanahdiyannahum","verse_key":"29:69"},{"pos":5,"ar":"سُبُلَنَا ۚ","en_gloss":"(to) Our ways","transliteration":"subulanā","verse_key":"29:69"},{"p