ir defeat","transliteration":"ghalabihim","verse_key":"30:3"},{"pos":8,"ar":"سَيَغْلِبُونَ","en_gloss":"will overcome","transliteration":"sayaghlibūna","verse_key":"30:3"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٣","en_gloss":"(3)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"30:3"}]},{"verse_key":"30:4","surah":30,"ayah":4,"ar_uthmani":"فِى بِضْعِ سِنِينَ ۗ لِلَّهِ ٱلْأَمْرُ مِن قَبْلُ وَمِنۢ بَعْدُ ۚ وَيَوْمَئِذٍ يَفْرَحُ ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"in a few years’ time––God is in command, first and last. On that day, the believers will rejoice","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"Within","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"30:4"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِضْعِ","en_gloss":"a few","transliteration":"biḍ'ʿi","verse_key":"30:4"},{"pos":3,"ar":"سِنِينَ ۗ","en_gloss":"years","transliteration":"sinīna","verse_key":"30:4"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"For Allah","transliteration":"lillahi","verse_key":"30:4"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْأَمْرُ","en_gloss":"(is) the command","transliteration":"l-amru","verse_key":"30:4"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"30:4"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قَبْلُ","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"qablu","verse_key":"30:4"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَمِنۢ","en_gloss":"and after","transliteration":"wamin","verse_key":"30:4"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بَعْدُ ۚ","en_gloss":"and after","transliteration":"baʿdu","verse_key":"30:4"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَيَوْمَئِذٍۢ","en_gloss":"And that day","transliteration":"wayawma-idhin","verse_key":"30:4"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَفْرَحُ","en_gloss":"will rejoice","transliteration":"yafraḥu","verse_key":"30:4"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"the believers","transliteration":"l-mu'minūna","verse_key":"30:4"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٤","en_gloss":"(4)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"30:4"}]},{"verse_key":"30:5","surah":30,"ayah":5,"ar_uthmani":"بِنَصْرِ ٱللَّهِ ۚ يَنصُرُ مَن يَشَآءُ ۖ وَهُوَ ٱلْعَزِيزُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"at God’s help. He helps whoever He pleases: He is the Mighty, the Merciful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"بِنَصْرِ","en_gloss":"With (the) help","transliteration":"binaṣri","verse_key":"30:5"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"30:5"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَنصُرُ","en_gloss":"He helps","transliteration":"yanṣuru","verse_key":"30:5"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"whom","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"30:5"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَشَآءُ ۖ","en_gloss":"He wills","transliteration":"yashāu","verse_key":"30:5"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"And He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"30:5"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْعَزِيزُ","en_gloss":"(is) the All-Mighty","transliteration":"l-ʿazīzu","verse_key":"30:5"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلرَّحِيمُ","en_gloss":"the Most Merciful","transliteration":"l-raḥīmu","verse_key":"30:5"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٥","en_gloss":"(5)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"30:5"}]}]}